      ⍝ regression (Bugs28 #100(d)): a bad (non-axis) token in bracket-
      ⍝ axis position for a reduction used to unconditionally dump an
      ⍝ internal debug trace (Token::get_function_axis()'s bare Q1()
      ⍝ call) before reporting the real AXIS ERROR.
      ⍝
